<http://linked.data.gov.au/def/tern-cv/5699eca7-9ef0-47a6-bcfb-9306e0e2b85e>
    schema:description "This controlled vocabulary covers parameter terms and their descriptions. It can be used for marking up Marine Community Profile metadata and a classified version of the terms is used to control faceted searching in the AODN/IMOS portal." ;
    schema:name "AODN Discovery Parameter Vocabulary" ;
.

